---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>블루프린트 스튜디오 — 건축·인테리어 설계</title>
  <meta name="description" content="블루프린트 스튜디오 | 서울 서초 기반 건축·인테리어 설계 사무소. 평면·단면 도면 설계, 시공 감리, 공간 컨설팅." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --blueprint: #0b3d91;
      --blueprint-deep: #082f6e;
      --blueprint-dark: #061f4a;
      --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
      --line-mid: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
      --line-faint: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
      --line-grid: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
      --line-grid-major: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
      --amber: #ffb000;
      --ink: #f4f7fc;
      --ink-dim: #aebfdb;
      --mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
      --sans: 'Archivo', system-ui, sans-serif;
      --gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: var(--sans);
      background: var(--blueprint);
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(var(--line-grid) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, var(--line-grid) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(var(--line-grid-major) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, var(--line-grid-major) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 25px 25px, 25px 25px, 125px 125px, 125px 125px;
      background-position: -1px -1px, -1px -1px, -1px -1px, -1px -1px;
    }

    a { color: inherit; }

    .mono { font-family: var(--mono); }

    /* ---- shared layout ---- */
    .wrap {
      max-width: 1240px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 clamp(1rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    }

    section { position: relative; }

    .section-label {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.32em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--amber);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .section-label::before {
      content: "";
      width: 34px;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--amber);
    }
    .section-label .num {
      color: var(--ink-dim);
      margin-left: auto;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* corner ticks helper */
    .frame {
      position: relative;
      border: 1px solid var(--line-faint);
    }

    /* ============ HERO ============ */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      padding-top: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 7rem);
      padding-bottom: 2rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-faint);
    }

    .hero-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding-bottom: 1.4rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-faint);
    }
    .logo-mark {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .logo-mark .glyph {
      width: 38px; height: 38px;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--line);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .logo-mark .glyph svg { display: block; }
    .logo-mark .name { font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.04em; font-size: 1rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .logo-mark .sub { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: var(--ink-dim); }

    .hero-meta {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--ink-dim);
      text-align: right;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }
    .hero-meta b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }

    .hero-body {
      flex: 1;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
      gap: var(--gap);
      align-items: center;
      padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem) 0;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 8vw, 6.4rem);
      line-height: 0.92;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .hero-title .out {
      -webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px var(--line);
      color: transparent;
    }
    .hero-tag {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.28em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--amber);
      margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
    }
    .hero-desc {
      color: var(--ink-dim);
      max-width: 46ch;
      margin-top: 1.8rem;
      font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.4vw, 1.05rem);
    }
    .hero-cta {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 2.2rem;
    }
    .btn {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 13px 22px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      transition: all .25s ease;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .btn-solid { background: var(--amber); color: var(--blueprint-dark); border-color: var(--amber); font-weight: 600; }
    .btn-solid:hover { background: transparent; color: var(--amber); }
    .btn-ghost:hover { background: var(--line); color: var(--blueprint); }

    /* hero drawing panel */
    .hero-draw {
      position: relative;
      aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
      border: 1px solid var(--line-mid);
      padding: 18px;
    }
    .hero-draw::before, .hero-draw::after {
      content: attr(data-c);
      position: absolute;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--ink-dim);
    }
    .hero-draw .tick { position: absolute; background: var(--amber); }
    .corner { position: absolute; width: 14px; height: 14px; border: 1.5px solid var(--amber); }
    .corner.tl { top: -1px; left: -1px; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; }
    .corner.tr { top: -1px; right: -1px; border-left: none; border-bottom: none; }
    .corner.bl { bottom: -1px; left: -1px; border-right: none; border-top: none; }
    .corner.br { bottom: -1px; right: -1px; border-left: none; border-top: none; }
    .hero-draw svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }

    .draw-caption {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 8px; left: 18px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      color: var(--ink-dim);
      background: var(--blueprint);
      padding: 0 6px;
    }
    .draw-scale-tag {
      position: absolute;
      top: 8px; right: 18px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      color: var(--amber);
      background: var(--blueprint);
      padding: 0 6px;
    }

    /* scale bar */
    .scalebar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      color: var(--ink-dim);
      margin-top: 1.2rem;
    }
    .scalebar .ruler { display: flex; height: 9px; border: 1px solid var(--line-mid); }
    .scalebar .ruler span { width: 26px; border-right: 1px solid var(--line-mid); }
    .scalebar .ruler span:nth-child(odd) { background: var(--line-mid); }
    .scalebar .ruler span:last-child { border-right: none; }

    /* ============ PROJECTS GRID ============ */
    .pad { padding: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-faint); }

    .proj-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1px;
      background: var(--line-faint);
      border: 1px solid var(--line-faint);
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
    }
    .proj {
      background: var(--blueprint);
      padding: 1.4rem;
      position: relative;
      transition: background .3s ease;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .proj:hover { background: var(--blueprint-deep); }
    .proj-num {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--amber);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .proj-num .scl { color: var(--ink-dim); }
    .proj-draw {
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
      border: 1px solid var(--line-faint);
      margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .proj-draw svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }
    .proj-name { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }
    .proj-type { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: var(--ink-dim); margin-top: 6px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .proj-foot {
      margin-top: auto;
      padding-top: 1rem;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--ink-dim);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line-faint);
    }
    .proj-foot b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }

    /* ============ PROCESS ============ */
    .proc-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 1px;
      background: var(--line-faint);
      border: 1px solid var(--line-faint);
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
    }
    .proc {
      background: var(--blueprint);
      padding: 1.8rem 1.4rem;
      position: relative;
      min-height: 230px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .proc-no {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      color: var(--amber);
      margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
    }
    .proc-icon {
      width: 56px; height: 56px;
      margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
    }
    .proc-icon svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }
    .proc h3 { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
    .proc p { color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: 0.88rem; }
    .proc-dim {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 1rem; right: 1.4rem;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--line-mid);
    }

    /* ============ TEAM ============ */
    .team-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1px;
      background: var(--line-faint);
      border: 1px solid var(--line-faint);
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
    }
    .member {
      background: var(--blueprint);
      padding: 1.6rem 1.4rem 1.4rem;
      position: relative;
    }
    .member-fig {
      aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
      border: 1px solid var(--line-faint);
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
    }
    .member-fig svg { width: 70%; height: 70%; display: block; }
    .member-fig .lbl {
      position: absolute; top: 8px; left: 10px;
      font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--ink-dim);
    }
    .member h3 { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.15rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .member .role { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--amber); margin: 5px 0 0.9rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .member .bio { color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: 0.85rem; }
    .member .lic { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--line-mid); margin-top: 1rem; padding-top: 0.9rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-faint); }

    .stat-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 1px;
      background: var(--line-faint);
      border: 1px solid var(--line-faint);
      margin-top: 1px;
    }
    .stat { background: var(--blueprint); padding: 1.6rem 1.4rem; }
    .stat .big { font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
    .stat .lab { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: var(--ink-dim); margin-top: 0.7rem; text-transform: uppercase; }

    /* ============ CONTACT / TITLE BLOCK ============ */
    .contact { padding: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem) 0 0; }
    .titleblock {
      border: 1.5px solid var(--line);
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    }
    .tb-main { border-right: 1.5px solid var(--line); }
    .tb-row { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-faint); padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem; }
    .tb-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .tb-k { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--amber); text-transform: uppercase; }
    .tb-v { font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 5px; }
    .tb-v.big { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem); font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    .tb-v a { text-decoration: none; }
    .tb-v a:hover { color: var(--amber); }

    .tb-side { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .tb-cell { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-faint); padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem; flex: 1; }
    .tb-cell:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .tb-cell .tb-k { margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .tb-cell .val { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--ink); }

    .tb-stamp {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      border-top: 1.5px solid var(--line);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      color: var(--ink-dim);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .tb-stamp .rev { display: flex; gap: 1.6rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .tb-stamp b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }

    footer {
      padding: 2.5rem 0;
      margin-top: 3rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line-faint);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      color: var(--ink-dim);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* dimension line helper visual */
    .dimline {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--ink-dim);
      margin-top: 1.4rem;
    }
    .dimline .seg { flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--line-faint); position: relative; }
    .dimline .seg::before, .dimline .seg::after {
      content: ""; position: absolute; top: -3px; width: 1px; height: 7px; background: var(--line-mid);
    }
    .dimline .seg::before { left: 0; }
    .dimline .seg::after { right: 0; }

    /* ---- responsive ---- */
    @media (max-width: 940px) {
      .hero-body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-draw { max-width: 460px; }
      .proj-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .proc-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .team-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .stat-row { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .hero-meta { text-align: left; }
      .proj-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .proc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .stat-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .titleblock { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .tb-main { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--line); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div style="position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:9999;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 16px;background:rgba(7,11,20,0.94);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:2px solid #ffb000;font-family:ui-monospace,'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em;">
  <a href="/portfolio" style="color:#ffb000;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">← PORTFOLIO</a>
  <span style="color:#8ea0b8;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;">SAMPLE 31 · 블루프린트 스튜디오 — 청사진 스타일</span>
  <a href="/contact" style="color:#070b14;background:#ffb000;padding:6px 12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:2px;">제작 문의 →</a>
</div>
<div style="height:40px;"></div>

<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap" style="width:100%;">
    <div class="hero-head">
      <div class="logo-mark">
        <div class="glyph">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3">
            <path d="M2 18 L11 3 L20 18 Z" />
            <path d="M6 18 L6 12 L16 12 L16 18" />
            <path d="M9 18 L9 15 L11 15 L11 18" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="name">블루프린트 스튜디오</div>
          <div class="sub">BLUEPRINT · ARCHITECTURE & INTERIOR</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta">
        DWG NO. <b>BP-2026-001</b><br>
        SCALE <b>1:100</b> &nbsp;·&nbsp; UNIT <b>mm</b><br>
        SEOUL, SEOCHO-GU &nbsp;·&nbsp; EST. <b>2014</b>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-body">
      <div>
        <p class="hero-tag">설계 · 시공 감리 · 공간 컨설팅</p>
        <h1 class="hero-title">선으로<br><span class="out">설계하는</span><br>공간</h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">
          모든 프로젝트는 한 장의 도면에서 시작됩니다. 블루프린트 스튜디오는
          주거·상업 공간의 평면과 단면을 밀리미터 단위로 설계하고, 시공 현장까지
          정밀하게 관리합니다. 도면의 정확성이 곧 공간의 완성도입니다.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-solid">설계 상담 신청 →</a>
          <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-ghost">프로젝트 도면</a>
        </div>
        <div class="scalebar">
          <span>0</span>
          <div class="ruler"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <span>5M &nbsp; SCALE 1:100</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- hero drawing: floor plan -->
      <div class="hero-draw">
        <div class="corner tl"></div><div class="corner tr"></div>
        <div class="corner bl"></div><div class="corner br"></div>
        <span class="draw-scale-tag">PLAN · 1:100</span>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 400 400" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke">
          <!-- outer walls -->
          <rect x="40" y="40" width="320" height="320" stroke-width="2.2"/>
          <rect x="48" y="48" width="304" height="304" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.4)" stroke-width="1"/>
          <!-- internal partitions -->
          <line x1="200" y1="48" x2="200" y2="210"/>
          <line x1="48" y1="210" x2="352" y2="210"/>
          <line x1="270" y1="210" x2="270" y2="352"/>
          <line x1="120" y1="210" x2="120" y2="352"/>
          <!-- door swings (arcs) -->
          <path d="M200 130 A30 30 0 0 1 170 160" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.6)"/>
          <line x1="200" y1="130" x2="200" y2="160" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.6)"/>
          <path d="M120 280 A26 26 0 0 0 146 306" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.6)"/>
          <line x1="120" y1="280" x2="120" y2="306" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.6)"/>
          <!-- windows on top wall -->
          <line x1="90" y1="40" x2="150" y2="40" stroke="#ffb000" stroke-width="2.5"/>
          <line x1="250" y1="40" x2="310" y2="40" stroke="#ffb000" stroke-width="2.5"/>
          <!-- furniture: bed -->
          <rect x="62" y="62" width="70" height="55" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.5)"/>
